    {
      "uid": "zhcn:a48aaa5c8089ef0bc09d5a07",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "我还以为下一场她铁定会以“日本杯”\n或“有马纪念”为目标呢。",
